# Registry Curation Rules

## Config Schema

```json
{
  "categories": ["experiments", "components", "collected", "hooks", "utilities", "styles"],
  "featured": ["slug1", "slug2"],
  "hidden": ["slug-to-exclude"],
  "overrides": { "slug": { "description": "..." } },
  "scan": {
    "experiments": true,
    "sharedUI": true,
    "collected": true,
    "hooks": true,
    "utilities": ["src/lib/utils.ts", "src/lib/fonts.ts"]
  }
}
```

## Downstream Impact

- **featured**: Items sorted to top of grid display in `index-slim.json`
- **hidden**: Excluded from all outputs (per-item JSON, indexes, MDX docs)
- **overrides**: Patches description or category on specific items (useful for terse component names)
- **scan toggles**: Control which directories `generate-registry-json.mjs` crawls
- **utilities**: Explicit file paths (not auto-discovered like other categories)

## After Changes

Re-run `npm run generate:registry` to regenerate all outputs:
- `registry.json` (manifest)
- `public/registry/{name}.json` (per-item, shadcn-compatible)
- `public/registry/index.json` + `index-slim.json` (indexes)
- `content/registry/**/*.mdx` (Fumadocs docs)
